{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿\nこんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X38CTCH00Y3NR8DBTPCNE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『渡邉理佐 卒業コンサート』\n会場にお越しくださった皆様、\n配信をご覧くださった皆様、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーをこのような形で送り出せることがとっても嬉しくて、\n温かく優しい雰囲気に包まれた今回のライブがいつもとはまた違ってとても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回廊まで出ることも多かったので、\n皆さんとより近くでお会いできて嬉しかったー！\nタオルもうちわもたくさん見えました！🙆‍♀️\nいつもありがとうーーーー！🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X39E372TRH4H0E34W1EDE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理佐ちゃん〜\n約７年間、お疲れ様〜\n卒業おめでとう🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時に優しく、時に厳しい言葉をかけてくれる\nりっちゃんにたくさん助けられてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しくなるな〜と言うと、\nあなたも卒業するじゃん、と言われてしまいそうだけど、\n今後の楽屋や現場にいないと思うとそれが短い期間ではあってもやっぱり寂しいです。\nよく一緒におふざけしてたからこそね、☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんありがとう〜〜💙🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん写真を撮ったので！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X3AERFWXRF4MTE2DSZ4QW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんちゃんの片耳掛け大好き〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X3BEDEYHT8KZTCSYZ45NK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X3CEVT779PKBEX4JVDQV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X3DF27Z0QGXZNPBM186X1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph",